; --- Time-of-day lever -------------------------------------------------------
; Plate lies flat on the west wall: thin in the mount's local X (the wall normal),
; 0.32 along the wall and 0.17 tall — wide enough to hold both the ball at the ends
; of its throw and the tick arc outside it, neither of which a 0.24 plate did. Its outer face sits 12 mm proud, the same
; relief the light switch beside it has.
